    "Each row represents ½ U. The order and occupancy come from NetBox. Occupied spaces can contain equipment hidden by your permissions; reservations and unmounted devices are not shown here.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each row represents ½ U. The order and occupancy come from NetBox. Occupied spaces can contain equipment hidden by your permissions; reservations and unmounted devices are not shown here."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Chaque ligne représente ½ U. L’ordre et l’occupation proviennent de NetBox. Les espaces occupés peuvent contenir des équipements masqués par vos permissions ; les réservations et les équipements non montés ne sont pas affichés ici."
          }
        }
      }
    },
